From: Noxwell <beebono@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 20:00:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] firmware: qcom: tzmem: disable SHM bridge on SM6125

With SHM bridge enabled, TZ rejects the Adreno zap shader metadata on
SM6125 with EINVAL, the same GPU firmware loading failure already seen
on SDM670. Add it to the list of platforms without working SHM bridge.
---
 drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_tzmem.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

--- a/drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_tzmem.c
+++ b/drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_tzmem.c
@@ -81,6 +81,7 @@ static const char *const qcom_tzmem_blacklist[] = {
 	"qcom,sc8180x",
 	"qcom,sdm670", /* failure in GPU firmware loading */
 	"qcom,sdm845", /* reset in rmtfs memory assignment */
+	"qcom,sm6125", /* failure in GPU firmware loading */
 	"qcom,sm7150", /* reset in rmtfs memory assignment */
 	"qcom,sm8150", /* reset in rmtfs memory assignment */
 	NULL
